{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00172",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.83,
      "end_seconds": 5.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor, the receptionist said you'd see me now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.97,
      "end_seconds": 8.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.09,
      "end_seconds": 17.77,
      "duration_seconds": 7.68,
      "text": "So, uh, I've been wanting to stop smoking, doctor. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.94,
      "end_seconds": 31.41,
      "duration_seconds": 12.47,
      "text": "It's quite normal to feel unsure at this point. People often expect an instant answer, but a good assessment usually has a few stages, and today is mainly about narrowing things down and making a sensible plan together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.57,
      "end_seconds": 34.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Oh, that's reassuring to hear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.06,
      "end_seconds": 36.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "Any low mood or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.18,
      "end_seconds": 41.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "No, no low mood or chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.22,
      "end_seconds": 56.45,
      "duration_seconds": 14.23,
      "text": "I'll be straight with you about how this works. Most of what we see in clinic turns out to be manageable, and the history you give me is often more useful than any single test, so thank you for being so detailed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.45,
      "end_seconds": 59.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Thank you, that really helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.32,
      "end_seconds": 64.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "What about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.82,
      "end_seconds": 66.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "My father was diabetic."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.88,
      "end_seconds": 69.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Do you have any questions before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.79,
      "end_seconds": 84.95,
      "duration_seconds": 11.16,
      "text": "Not at the moment, um, I think you've covered most of what I was wondering. If something comes to mind later, I'll ask you before I leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.37,
      "end_seconds": 92.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.32,
      "end_seconds": 99.87,
      "duration_seconds": 6.55,
      "text": "High blood pressure, for about a year. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.42,
      "end_seconds": 114.43,
      "duration_seconds": 14.01,
      "text": "Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.03,
      "end_seconds": 118.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Well, good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.58,
      "end_seconds": 121.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.95,
      "end_seconds": 124.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "No, never had any surgery."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.93,
      "end_seconds": 130.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "Is it all right if a trainee sits in later? No? Fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.11,
      "end_seconds": 134.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Right, I'd rather not, if you don't mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.4,
      "end_seconds": 139.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.07,
      "end_seconds": 143.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Eggs. I come out in... well, a rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.51,
      "end_seconds": 147.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.73,
      "end_seconds": 162.77,
      "duration_seconds": 14.04,
      "text": "Not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.08,
      "end_seconds": 170.55,
      "duration_seconds": 6.47,
      "text": "Any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.96,
      "end_seconds": 174.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Telmisartan, 40 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.94,
      "end_seconds": 178.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "I'm just saving what we've covered so far."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.67,
      "end_seconds": 194.39,
      "duration_seconds": 6.72,
      "text": "Right, carry on. Just to be sure I've got this right, the telmisartan, what dose was that again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.37,
      "end_seconds": 196.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.11,
      "text": "40 milligrams. Yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.16,
      "end_seconds": 202.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.29,
      "end_seconds": 206.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Now bend it for me, slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.4,
      "end_seconds": 224.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "Chest sounds clear, a bit of wheeze when you breathe out hard."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.71,
      "end_seconds": 226.41,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.04,
      "end_seconds": 244.88,
      "duration_seconds": 15.84,
      "text": "Okay, all done, thank you, please sit down. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together. Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 246.18,
      "end_seconds": 256.0,
      "duration_seconds": 9.82,
      "text": "Yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.26,
      "end_seconds": 267.14,
      "duration_seconds": 9.88,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: This looks most like nicotine dependence. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 268.52,
      "end_seconds": 270.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Is it something serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.04,
      "end_seconds": 278.16,
      "duration_seconds": 6.12,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now nicotine dependence is my leading thought, not anything worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.8,
      "end_seconds": 282.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 282.43,
      "end_seconds": 283.13,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.22,
      "end_seconds": 319.89,
      "duration_seconds": 22.67,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. We should do breathing tests for smoker's cough. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. Let's use nicotine patches, 14 milligrams, once a day, for six weeks. That should help with smoking cessation. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 320.39,
      "end_seconds": 323.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Okay, and I take that after food?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.97,
      "end_seconds": 341.66,
      "duration_seconds": 17.69,
      "text": "Pick a quit date this month, and tell your family so they can back you up. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle. If the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 342.86,
      "end_seconds": 345.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Oh, yes, I'll do that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.13,
      "end_seconds": 354.45,
      "duration_seconds": 8.32,
      "text": "Let's review you in four weeks. Before we finish, can you repeat the plan back to me so I know I haven't been confusing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 355.74,
      "end_seconds": 359.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "So, I come back in four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 359.78,
      "end_seconds": 364.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Take care, and don't hesitate to call if anything changes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 368.15,
      "end_seconds": 372.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Nothing more from me, you know, doctor, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 376.49,
      "end_seconds": 378.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Bye for now, look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}